{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN391MV99JV7ZDMTZZHAQ5F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、電子レンジでよく温野菜を作ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN39302FVR2TCHHFWG3Q9AE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nキャベツたまねぎなすエリンギ(底にある)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンソメを入れるのも好きですが、野菜の味が好きなので、野菜の味が消えないようによくオリーブオイルをかけて食べます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリーブオイルは好きなので、お豆腐とかにかけたりして食べたりしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリーブオイルは、ヒカリエのオリーブオイル専門店のです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリーブオイルは体にいいらしいのでみんなで摂取していきましょ〜(❁´ω`❁)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN394E0PAHT004ZZWSF3CHP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN395MQ05CSAPBBWM91GAWP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね!\n読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}